# Controls the EAS build upload payload.
# NOTE: a .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for EAS uploads, so junk is listed
# here, while credential files (google-services.json) and .env.local are
# deliberately NOT ignored — they must reach the build for Google Sign-In
# and the Supabase config (extra) to work.
#
# The prebuilt android/ project is INCLUDED (not listed below) so EAS builds
# our exact generated Gradle files — pinning Kotlin 1.9.25 (Compose Compiler
# 1.5.15 fix) — rather than regenerating them remotely.

node_modules
.expo
dist
web-build
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
GoogleService-Info.plist
android/local.properties
android/.gradle
android/build
android/.cxx
android/.idea
android/*.iml
android/app/build
